Commit:     Martin Giger <martin@humanoids.be>
CommitDate: Tue Jan 13 18:32:04 2026 -0500

    Bug 2008517 - Abolish abortables (in account creation). r=mkmelin


    Every time I'd look at this code I could feel the calls of the old one. So I've decided to finally
    improve the sanity of this code by converting it to Promises and AbortSignals. I have split off the
    other modernization into its own patch whenever possible to keep this as small as possible.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D277843

